<ui:UXML editor-extension-mode="False" uss="L2StyleSheet" uss="L2Scrollview" uss="L2Button" uss="LicenseWindow" xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements">
  <ui:VisualElement name="LicenseWindow" class="license-window">
    <ui:VisualElement name="Window" tabindex="-1" class="license-window-inner">
      <ui:ScrollView name="L2Scrollview" class="l2-scroll-view">
        <ui:Label text="INFINITY
Project SPARK

TERMS OF USE - ALPHA

Welcome to Infinity. Please read these terms before you play.

1. This client is provided free of charge, only for playing on the official Infinity server. You may not copy, redistribute, sell, modify, decompile or extract its files or contents.

2. Cheats, bots, macros, packet editors, memory tools and any third-party program that interferes with the game are forbidden and may lead to a permanent ban.

3. Your account is personal. Do not share your login. The staff will never ask for your password.

4. This is an alpha version. Characters, items and progress may be wiped at any time, and the game is provided &quot;as is&quot;, without any warranty.

5. By clicking Agree you accept these terms. If you do not agree, click Disagree and close the game.


ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS

Special thanks to shnok, creator of the l2-unity project - the open Unity client this game was built upon.

Special thanks to the L2jFrozen Team, whose server emulator is the foundation of our game server.


Lineage II is a trademark of NCSOFT Corporation. Infinity is an independent fan project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by NCSOFT.
" name="Content" class="chat-content" />
      </ui:ScrollView>
      <ui:VisualElement name="BottomBar" class="license-window-button-container">
        <ui:Instance template="L2Button" template="L2Button" name="AgreeButton" class="l2-button-template" />
        <ui:Instance template="L2Button" template="L2Button" name="DisagreeButton" class="l2-button-template" />
      </ui:VisualElement>
    </ui:VisualElement>
  </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>